[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12542.389, "timestamp": "03:29:02", "text": "或者我会尝试这样做吗？ 与此同时，赤村。   是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12544.469, "timestamp": "03:29:04", "text": "。 他就像是说，我能感觉到枪膛里装的是什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12546.55, "timestamp": "03:29:06", "text": "。 我感觉到了，然后"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12550.55, "timestamp": "03:29:10", "text": "他就开枪打死了我。 我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12552.55, "timestamp": "03:29:12", "text": "我正在计算一切。 与此同时，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12554.309, "timestamp": "03:29:14", "text": "这混蛋居然毫无预兆地杀了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12563.51, "timestamp": "03:29:23", "text": "好的，"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 12569.631, "timestamp": "03:29:29", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "🤣"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12576.87, "timestamp": "03:29:36", "text": "好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12579.83, "timestamp": "03:29:39", "text": "哦，不。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12584.87, "timestamp": "03:29:44", "text": "我不喜欢那样。 我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12588.79, "timestamp": "03:29:48", "text": "顺便一提，用刀砍断枪管时，造成的伤害是双倍的。 是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12591.269, "timestamp": "03:29:51", "text": "它又以双管齐下的形式回归了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12594.229, "timestamp": "03:29:54", "text": "。 就像短枪管一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12596.07, "timestamp": "03:29:56", "text": "枪管就……嗯。 恢复到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12598.83, "timestamp": "03:29:58", "text": "正常大小，而不是"}]